### Filtro non corrispondente — atteso 200, nessuna richiesta al listener
POST {{proxyUrl}}/wh?refMatch=v*.*.*&forwardMethod=POST&forwardUrl={{targetUrl}}/listener/github
Content-Type: application/json
X-GitHub-Event: push

{
  "ref": "refs/heads/main"
}

### Errore del target — il listener risponde 503, il proxy risponde 500
POST {{proxyUrl}}/wh?refMatch=v*.*.*&forwardMethod=POST&forwardUrl={{targetUrl}}/listener/github
Content-Type: application/json
X-GitHub-Event: push
X-Set-Response-Status-Code: 503

{
  "ref": "refs/tags/v0.12.1"
}
